    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ9S3rlpX0aS4RxL8wl8-ILCA/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNRdHVHeS1nRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 years ago",
      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "Affordable price of food and beverages. But the chicken bowl got so much rice on it with just a little chicken. I prefer its fried rice (nasi goreng spesial mantan). The ambience is not good. They try so hard in order to fit the youngster, but the result is not quite good. The music is so loud, and it came from a bad speaker, more like a disturbing than comforting.\n\nOther than that, it packed with some uncivilized kids (alay).",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Affordable price of food and beverages. But the chicken bowl got so much rice on it with just a little chicken. I prefer its fried rice (nasi goreng spesial mantan). The ambience is not good. They try so hard in order to fit the youngster, but the result is not quite good. The music is so loud, and it came from a bad speaker, more like a disturbing than comforting.\n\nOther than that, it packed with some uncivilized kids (alay).",
